{"quest_id": 4235, "name": "賢者の石", "description": "王国を巨大な実験場にしようと企む\n錬金術士コリンの狙いとは？\n＜防御力が５０％低下＞\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "modifier_notes": ["防御力が５０％低下"], "event": "錬金術士と賢者の石", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920038, "map_no": 3078, "level": 90, "multiplier": 0.9, "charisma": 15, "exp": 140, "gold": 500, "drops": [{"card": 227, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "modifiers": [{"kind": "term", "influence": 13, "params": [50]}], "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 13, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 576, "attack": 126, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 11, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 900, "attack": 135, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097184, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 2, "spawn_sec": 20}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 5400, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 100, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2099072, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 68, "missile": {"speed": 2.0, "splash": 107}, "master_id": 153, "global_id": 152, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 46}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、どうやら報告にあったアルケミストが\nいるのはここのようです。", "face": "l23e887cdb950"}, {"name": "コリン", "text": "来たか。お前が王子だな。\n私はコリン……。\nそう、コリンだ。", "face": "u227"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "あなたは……。\nもしや報告にあったアルケミストですか？", "face": "l23e887cdb950"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "なぜ王国を実験場にしようと……？", "face": "l23e887cdb950"}, {"name": "コリン", "text": "私は錬金術によって、この世の真理を見たい。\nそのためにはこの賢者の石を使い\nこの国を実験場にする必要がある。", "face": "u227"}, {"name": "コリン", "text": "だが、王子よ。お前の存在が邪魔だ。\n私の願いのためにも、倒させていただく。", "face": "u227"}, {"name": "コリン", "text": "いけ！　魔物たちよ！\n賢者の石の力によって\n王子たちの防御力は低下している。", "face": "u227"}, {"name": "コリン", "text": "その隙を狙うのだ！", "face": "u227"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "賢者の石……！？\nもし彼女の言葉通りだとしたら\n王子、ここは慎重に行きましょう！", "face": "l23e887cdb950"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "コリン", "text": "チッ……。\nそう簡単にはいかないか。", "face": "u227"}, {"name": "コリン", "text": "だが「あのお方」に譲り受けたこの力……。\n素晴らしい……。\nこれさえあれば真理を見る日も近い……。", "face": "u227"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "いったい彼女は何なのでしょう。\nそれと先ほど話していた賢者の石……。\nとりあえず後を追った方がよさそうです。", "face": "l23e887cdb950"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920038_3078", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 25, "y": 290}, {"k": "m", "x": 717, "y": 308, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 583, "y": 303, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 566, "y": 221, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 498, "y": 201, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 419, "y": 191, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 335, "y": 187, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 262, "y": 226, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 522, "y": 408, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 445, "y": 415, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 369, "y": 412, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 281, "y": 362, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 238, "y": 287, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 148, "y": 270, "id": 212}, {"k": "r", "x": 657, "y": 262, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 627, "y": 376, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 501, "y": 271, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 415, "y": 241, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 337, "y": 258, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 343, "y": 312, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 413, "y": 343, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 495, "y": 339, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 538, "y": 159, "id": 308}, {"k": "r", "x": 